# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
# Build output only (root-level) — NOT demo/public/, which holds tracked
# static assets (robots.txt etc.) that Vite copies verbatim into that build
# output.
/public
# The one exception within demo/public/ itself: generated from README.md by
# scripts/generate-llms-full.mjs on every demo build, so it's never
# hand-edited and would only ever go stale if committed.
demo/public/llms-full.txt
*.local
.env
coverage
.superpowers
# Scratch drop zone for files handed to Claude mid-session (e.g. images to
# place elsewhere in the repo) — never meant to be committed as-is.
/TMP

